    "description": "<div class=\"p-head\"><h1 class=\"p-title\">Clamp to Range</h1><div class=\"p-meta\"><span class=\"pill lv-junior\">junior</span></div></div><h2>Context</h2>\n<p>Clamping keeps a value inside bounds \u2014 below the floor it becomes the floor,</p>\n<p>above the ceiling it becomes the ceiling.</p>\n<h2>Task</h2>\n<p>Implement <code>Clamp</code> in clampf.go with an inclusive range.</p>\n<p>Do <strong>not</strong> change the function signature or the tests.</p>\n<h2>Examples</h2>\n<pre class=\"md\"><code>\nClamp(5, 0, 10)   // =&gt; 5\nClamp(-3, 0, 10)  // =&gt; 0\nClamp(99, 0, 10)  // =&gt; 10\n</code></pre>\n<details class=\"topics-foot\"><summary class=\"topics-lbl\">Topics <span class=\"topics-n\">3</span></summary><div class=\"tchips\"><span class=\"tchip\">Conditional logic</span><span class=\"tchip\">Inclusive bounds</span><span class=\"tchip\">Single return</span></div></details>",
