    "title": "Clamp Each Element",
    "level": "junior",
    "tag": "backend",
    "description": "<div class=\"p-head\"><h1 class=\"p-title\">Clamp Each Element</h1><div class=\"p-meta\"><span class=\"pill lv-junior\">junior</span></div></div><h2>Context</h2>\n<p>Mapping a transform over a slice into a fresh result keeps the caller's data</p>\n<p>intact while a <code>for range</code> applies the per-element rule.</p>\n<h2>Task</h2>\n<p>Implement <code>ClampAll</code> in clamploop.go.</p>\n<p>Do <strong>not</strong> change the function signature or the tests.</p>\n<h2>Examples</h2>\n<pre class=\"md\"><code>\nClampAll([]int{-5,3,20}, 0, 10) // =&gt; [0 3 10]\nClampAll(nil, 0, 10)            // =&gt; []\nClampAll([]int{5}, 0, 10)       // =&gt; [5]\n</code></pre>\n<details class=\"topics-foot\"><summary class=\"topics-lbl\">Topics <span class=\"topics-n\">3</span></summary><div class=\"tchips\"><span class=\"tchip\">Map over a slice</span><span class=\"tchip\">Per-element clamp</span><span class=\"tchip\">Non-destructive</span></div></details>",
