    "description": "<div class=\"p-head\"><h1 class=\"p-title\">Max of Three</h1><div class=\"p-meta\"><span class=\"pill lv-junior\">junior</span></div></div><h2>Context</h2>\n<p>Combining comparisons is the bread-and-butter of small helper functions.</p>\n<h2>Task</h2>\n<p>Implement <code>Max3</code> in max3.go.</p>\n<p>Do <strong>not</strong> change the function signature or the tests.</p>\n<h2>Examples</h2>\n<pre class=\"md\"><code>\nMax3(1, 2, 3)    // =&gt; 3\nMax3(5, 9, 5)    // =&gt; 9\nMax3(-1, -2, -3) // =&gt; -1\n</code></pre>\n<details class=\"topics-foot\"><summary class=\"topics-lbl\">Topics <span class=\"topics-n\">3</span></summary><div class=\"tchips\"><span class=\"tchip\">Comparison chaining</span><span class=\"tchip\">Negatives</span><span class=\"tchip\">Single result</span></div></details>",
