    "description": "<div class=\"p-head\"><h1 class=\"p-title\">Weekday Switch</h1><div class=\"p-meta\"><span class=\"pill lv-junior\">junior</span><span class=\"p-time\">10 min</span></div></div><h2>Context</h2>\n<p>A scheduler prints a day name from its number. A <code>switch</code> is cleaner than a</p>\n<p>long if-ladder here \u2014 but an out-of-range number still needs a sensible answer.</p>\n<h2>Task</h2>\n<p>Implement <code>Weekday</code> in weekday.go using a <code>switch</code>: 1\u2192\"Monday\" \u2026</p>\n<p>7\u2192\"Sunday\", anything else \u2192 \"Unknown\".</p>\n<p>Do <strong>not</strong> change the function signature or the tests.</p>\n<h2>Examples</h2>\n<pre class=\"md\"><code>\nWeekday(1) // =&gt; \"Monday\"\nWeekday(7) // =&gt; \"Sunday\"\nWeekday(0) // =&gt; \"Unknown\"\nWeekday(8) // =&gt; \"Unknown\"\n</code></pre>\n<details class=\"topics-foot\"><summary class=\"topics-lbl\">Topics <span class=\"topics-n\">3</span></summary><div class=\"tchips\"><span class=\"tchip\">Expression switch</span><span class=\"tchip\">No auto fallthrough</span><span class=\"tchip\">default</span></div></details>",
    "education": "",
    "starter": "// Package weekday \u2014 Gopher Workplace challenge.\npackage weekday\n\n// Weekday maps a day number 1\u20137 (Monday=1 \u2026 Sunday=7) to its name using a\n// switch. Any number outside 1\u20137 returns \"Unknown\".\n//\n// Examples:\n//\n//\tWeekday(1) => \"Monday\"\n//\tWeekday(7) => \"Sunday\"\n//\tWeekday(0) => \"Unknown\"\n//\tWeekday(8) => \"Unknown\"\nfunc Weekday(d int) string {\n\t// TODO(candidate): implement this from scratch so all tests pass.\n\tpanic(\"not implemented\")\n}\n",
