    "description": "<div class=\"p-head\"><h1 class=\"p-title\">Map Over Slice</h1><div class=\"p-meta\"><span class=\"pill lv-middle\">middle</span></div></div><h2>Context</h2>\n<p>Passing a function as an argument makes a transform generic: the caller decides</p>\n<p>the per-element operation.</p>\n<h2>Task</h2>\n<p>Implement <code>MapInts</code> in mapints.go returning a new slice.</p>\n<p>Do <strong>not</strong> change the function signature or the tests.</p>\n<h2>Examples</h2>\n<pre class=\"md\"><code>\nMapInts([]int{1,2,3}, square) // =&gt; [1 4 9]\nMapInts(nil, f)               // =&gt; []\nMapInts([]int{2}, inc)        // =&gt; [3]\n</code></pre>\n<details class=\"topics-foot\"><summary class=\"topics-lbl\">Topics <span class=\"topics-n\">3</span></summary><div class=\"tchips\"><span class=\"tchip\">Function as a parameter</span><span class=\"tchip\">Build new slice</span><span class=\"tchip\">First-class functions</span></div></details>",
