    "description": "<div class=\"p-head\"><h1 class=\"p-title\">Memoize a Function</h1><div class=\"p-meta\"><span class=\"pill lv-middle\">middle</span></div></div><h2>Context</h2>\n<p>A closure can own a map as private state, turning any pure function into a</p>\n<p>cached one without changing its signature.</p>\n<h2>Task</h2>\n<p>Implement <code>Memoize</code> in memoize.go.</p>\n<p>Do <strong>not</strong> change the function signature or the tests.</p>\n<h2>Examples</h2>\n<pre class=\"md\"><code>\nm := Memoize(square); m(4) // =&gt; 16 (computes)\nm(4)                       // =&gt; 16 (cached, no recompute)\nm(5)                       // computes once\n</code></pre>\n<details class=\"topics-foot\"><summary class=\"topics-lbl\">Topics <span class=\"topics-n\">3</span></summary><div class=\"tchips\"><span class=\"tchip\">Closure-owned map</span><span class=\"tchip\">comma-ok lookup</span><span class=\"tchip\">Compute-and-store</span></div></details>",
